  "term": "Vyvanse",
  "definition": "Vyvanse is a brand name for lisdexamfetamine dimesylate, a central nervous system stimulant. It is a prodrug that is converted in the body to dextroamphetamine, which increases noradrenaline and dopamine activity in the brain and can change alertness, excitement, appetite, and blood pressure.",
